{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bist Squad</strong> is a small 1-bit roguelite where you explore dungeons, hatch mysterious eggs, and build a team of Bists to survive all the way to the final floor\u2026 where a ruthless fight awaits you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No tutorial. No help.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Bist Squad</i> trusts you to figure out its mechanics on your own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to build the <strong>ultimate</strong> Bist Squad?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A short game\u00a0</strong>\ud83c\udfae</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Bist Squad</i> is a deliberately concise experience: it can be finished in under 2 hours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yes, technically, you could finish it and ask for a refund\u2026 \ud83d\ude05</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But if you enjoy it and want me to keep making other games, it would mean a lot if you didn\u2019t \u2764\ufe0f</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Automatic turn-based battles\u00a0</strong>\u2694\ufe0f</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909710/extras/1c32b263892ec1f87ecb30ff84ef5f6c.poster.avif?t=1770390872\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909710/extras/1c32b263892ec1f87ecb30ff84ef5f6c.webm?t=1770390872\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909710/extras/1c32b263892ec1f87ecb30ff84ef5f6c.mp4?t=1770390872\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Creature collection and evolution\u00a0</strong>\ud83d\udc23</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909710/extras/f23d6